<title>GREECE: Table of Greek central bank fixing rates, Aug 18.</title>
<headline>Table of Greek central bank fixing rates, Aug 18.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Aug 18	Aug 14   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  285.470     288.970     247.020    15.57 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  308.600     308.600     306.830     0.58 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.195     157.150     158.970    -1.12 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.662	46.618	47.182    -1.10 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  458.960     456.900     419.180     9.49 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.605     139.510     141.685    -1.47 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.079	16.063	16.185    -0.65 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  242.580     247.610     212.430    14.19 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.860	 1.859	1.8880    -1.48 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.550	 1.549	1.5810    -1.96 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.700     190.295     183.135     3.58 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December 31, 1996 rate. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
